<BaseLayout title="About — Cuu Pham">
  <section class="intro"><p class="eyebrow">About this space</p><h1>A place to share<br />what matters.</h1><p class="muted">This site is built around ideas, knowledge and things worth exploring. It is intentionally open-ended: technology can sit beside games, stories, music and everything else that deserves a thoughtful write-up.</p></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.intro{max-width:760px;padding:110px 0}.intro h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,8vw,6rem);line-height:.95;margin:20px 0 35px}.intro .muted{font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8}</style>
